    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1664">

                <pb facs="1416" n="1312" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1312"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.114M69/130.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 193.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reference to my cablegram of May 1,
                    announcing the sinking in the port of Smyrna on April 29 of the American
                    steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Texas</hi> belonging to the Archipelago
                    American Steamship Company, I now have the honor to transmit herewith copies of
                    the telegrams received by me from Consul General Plorton and of those sent him
                    by this Embassy<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1664-f1"/> bearing on the subject down to
                    the date of writing. * * *</p>
                <p>I inclose also copy of the telegraphic instruction based on your cablegram of the
                    8th instant, which I have sent to the Consul General at Smyrna today.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1664-a1.xml" xpointer="d1664-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
